{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_69_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_69_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"二、夏，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、曹伯伐鄭，圍新城。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_69_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"伐國不言圍邑，此其言圍何也？病鄭也，著鄭伯之罪也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_69_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"三、秋，楚人圍許，諸侯遂救許。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_69_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"善救許也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_69_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"四、冬，公至自伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_69_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_69","textTraditional":"其不以救許致何也？大伐鄭也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}